IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `npa-polytechnic`

-- Nanyang Polytechnic Act 1992, ss 4(2), 5A, 12, 15 and Schedule ss 5, 6, 8 to 12, 14, 16, 17 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_nanyang-polytechnic-act-1992.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 4(2) -- execution under seal`

