#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is duly executed under seal` FALSE `the Principal` `an appointed Board member`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is duly executed under seal` TRUE `the Principal` `the Principal`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is duly executed under seal` TRUE `a Deputy Principal` `a Deputy Principal`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is duly executed under seal` TRUE `the Principal` `the Registrar`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is duly executed under seal` TRUE `the Chairperson` `an appointed Board member`

